<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/42/eng@/~cl_40__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "An offer under subsection (1) may be made at any time after the offence has been committed, but before any prosecution for it has been instituted, and where the amount specified in the offer has not been paid within the period specified in the offer or any extension of it which the Licensing Officer may grant, prosecution for the offence may be instituted at any time thereafter against the person to whom the offer is made."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/42/eng@> .
